### Feature Session — PERFIL, PERMISOS Y LOGOUT

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### PERFIL — JWT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

###

### MIS PERMISOS — JWT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/permisos
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

###

### PERFIL sin token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/perfil

###

### LOGOUT — OPEN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{loginAdmin.response.body.$.refresh_token}}"
}

###

### Refresh después de logout -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{loginAdmin.response.body.$.refresh_token}}"
}
